Typescript:
Setup Typescript with React:
Follow same command on setting up the project using vite but just select typescript instead of javascript. extension.tsx
Typescript is same as javascript but has additional feature, like we can mention what type of variable is . Eg below
const message: string = 'hello';
so when we type message. it will give all auto suggestion related to the varibale type string like toUpperCase etc. .length etc.
If our project has any error, it wont allow us to build as well, it will throw error but javascript wont allow
It also have feature called type inference, we no need to mention explictily like this const message: string = 'hello'; we can give like this const message = 'hello';, it will automatically detect its type and when we give . only it will give string releated suggestion

